# The VS Code extension ships the manifest, the licence, the changelog, the icon and the five skills, nothing else.
# vsce adds the README from vscode/README.md (--readme-path). tools/check_vsix.py checks the package's file list.
**
!package.json
!LICENSE
!CHANGELOG.md
!plugins/infra-pack/.claude-plugin/icon.png
!plugins/infra-pack/skills/*/SKILL.md
